track alphaGenome
shortLabel AlphaGenome
longLabel AlphaGenome Variant Impact (AVI) Score for all single-base substitutions (zoom in for scores)
type bigWig
compositeTrack on
parent predictionScoresSuper
visibility dense
color 0,114,178
maxWindowToDraw 10000000
mouseOverFunction noAverage
tableBrowser off
dataVersion AlphaGenome Variant Impact score, Google DeepMind snapshot of August 27, 2026

    track alphaGenomeA
